# Folder Compress To Potentially Suspicious Output Via Compress-Archive Cmdlet | T1074.001 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_powershell_zip_compress.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1 (CommandLine IN ("*Compress-Archive -Path*-DestinationPath $env:TEMP*", "*Compress-Archive -Path*-DestinationPath*\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\*", "*Compress-Archive -Path*-DestinationPath*:\\Windows\\Temp\\*"))
